&lt;li&gt;Advise the leadership team on essential technical considerations related to ensuring engineering excellence and successful high impact key initiatives.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leadership on strategic planning and improve our systems and processes while upholding our&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.discordapp.com/the-four-values-of-working-at-discord-90d5b5102cbc&quot;&gt; workplace philosophy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
