&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive hands-on experience leveraging and implementing AI technologies to transform workflows and drive innovation, with demonstrated ability to architect solutions that go beyond basic prompt engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience partnering with engineering teams building and deploying internal tools using a variety of AI technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advocacy Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Passion for AI and the ability to articulate its value to both technical and non-technical audiences, fostering adoption across diverse teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to develop and execute large-scale programs across organizations or companies, with a focus on measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience collaborating across engineering, product, and other functions to deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-Solving Orientation:&lt;/strong&gt; A proactive, solutions-focused mindset with a track record of driving innovative outcomes in ambiguous or complex situations.&lt;/li&gt;
